          <mxGeometry height="75" width="1390" x="1655" y="1155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="process_content" parent="QQxhCsp-Hkec8rBMu7C_-2" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ddd6fe;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 24px 28px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);&quot;&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 42px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(109, 40, 217);&quot;&gt;A. Comparative Synthesis &amp;amp; Gap Remediation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; • Systems analysis translating Manual/SaaS pain-points into automated software logic&lt;br&gt; • Symmetrical 2-Sides Modeling: Unified database powering Web &amp;amp; Mobile clients&lt;br&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-style: dashed none none; border-color: rgb(221, 214, 254) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: 16px 0px;&quot;&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 42px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(109, 40, 217);&quot;&gt;B. Cybernetic Rules &amp;amp; Algorithmic Engines:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; • &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collision Prevention Algorithm:&lt;/b&gt; Real-time schedule overlap interceptor protecting unit availability across all channels&lt;br&gt; • &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1-Click Rapid Key Dispatch:&lt;/b&gt; Instant state transitions (&lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Hand Over Key&lt;/i&gt; → &lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;picked up&lt;/i&gt;; &lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Return Key&lt;/i&gt; → &lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;completed&lt;/i&gt;) bypassing clunky paperwork&lt;br&gt; • &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Dual Multi-Angle Digital Inspection:&lt;/b&gt; Standardized departure vs. return photographic evidence &amp;amp; odometer/fuel logging&lt;br&gt; • &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Automated Financial Calculations:&lt;/b&gt; Dynamic pricing, late penalties, extension delta computations, &amp;amp; consignor commission shares &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1420" width="1390" x="1655" y="1250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_output" parent="QQxhCsp-Hkec8rBMu7C_-2" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=3;shadow=1;" value="" vertex="1">
